      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate recorded a gross prior year reserve strengthening of approximately GBP 4.7m (c.2.6% of opening gross claims outstanding), driven by adverse movements on the 2020 and 2021 underwriting years partially offset by small releases on earlier years. The report also states a net (after reinsurance) adverse prior year development of GBP 9.5m. Named catastrophe activity in 2022 (notably Hurricane Ian, French hailstorms and the Ukraine conflict) materially contributed to prior-year losses, and a November 2022 commutation of cessions for 2018-2020 removed the syndicate's future liabilities for those cessions.",
